    {
      "issue": "Initial working interpretation equated group reference with incoming requested event.",
      "resolution": "Independent review tracked X23 overwrite: first collected event controls reference flag. Fresh1002ede48 capture also binds count>1. Initial parent messages are superseded; no prior sealed study changed."
    }
  ],
